<para>The sample offset takes the channels into account. If you have a time offset instead, you can easily find the corresponding sample offset with the following formula: <computeroutput>timeInSeconds * sampleRate * channelCount</computeroutput> If the given offset exceeds to total number of samples, this function must jump to the end of the file.</para>
